etting)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46B.46DE26\">HIV.B.DE26</a></td><td>Family planning clinic</td><td>The client tested at a family planning clinic</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46B.46DE27\">HIV.B.DE27</a></td><td>Other facility-level testing</td><td>The client tested at another type of facility</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46B.46DE28\">HIV.B.DE28</a></td><td>Tuberculosis (TB) clinic</td><td>The client tested at a TB clinic</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
